// The DAO's vault — the DAO's own liquidity positions.
//
// Holds liquidity positions owned by the DAO rather than by any person, and
// claims their fees. It can only be operated through governance proposals, so
// the liquidity standing underneath the peg is not something any individual
// can withdraw.
//
// The implementation lives in a private repository until launch. Its behaviour
// is documented in docs/architecture/ — see architecture.md.
